{"id":"faculty-abhishek_sharma:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Abhishek Sharma is an Assistant Professor in the Electronics and Communication Engineering discipline. Prior to joining IIIT-NR, he was an Assistant Professor, in Jabalpur Engineering College, Jabalpur for more than one year. Dr. Sharma has received his Ph.D. in Signal Processing from IIT Guwahati, M.Tech. in Radio Frequency Design and Technology from IIT Delhi and B.E. in Electronics and Telecommunication Engineering from Government Engineering College Raipur. He was recipient of scholarship provided by the Governor of Chhattisgarh\nDr. Sharma has published several articles in journals and conference proceedings of international repute.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
